    "file": ".claude/skills/game-prd-check/references/rules/hzmj_game_flow_handler/hzmj_game_flow_handler/32-重连-场景做牌.md",
    "section": "一、末段",
    "fromLine": 16,
    "toLine": 16,
    "text": "最后如果带加倍数据，还会刷新一次加倍状态",
    "mandatory": true
  },
  {
    "ruleId": "R06-041",
    "file": ".claude/skills/game-prd-check/references/rules/hzmj_game_flow_handler/hzmj_game_flow_handler/32-重连-场景做牌.md",
    "section": "二、背景",
    "fromLine": 22,
    "toLine": 22,
    "text": "背景显示匹配场底分与牌桌美术字",
    "mandatory": true
  },
  {
    "ruleId": "R06-042",
    "file": ".claude/skills/game-prd-check/references/rules/hzmj_game_flow_handler/hzmj_game_flow_handler/32-重连-场景做牌.md",
    "section": "二、玩家头像",
    "fromLine": 23,
    "toLine": 23,
    "text": "玩家头像显示庄家标记；加倍标记先清后按数据重刷",
    "mandatory": true
  },
  {
    "ruleId": "R06-043",
    "file": ".claude/skills/game-prd-check/references/rules/hzmj_game_flow_handler/hzmj_game_flow_handler/32-重连-场景做牌.md",
    "section": "二、牌桌中央",
    "fromLine": 24,
    "toLine": 24,
    "text": "牌桌中央显示方位盘底图与四角风向灯、骰子静态点数、剩余张数",
    "mandatory": true
  },
  {
    "ruleId": "R06-044",
    "file": ".claude/skills/game-prd-check/references/rules/hzmj_game_flow_handler/hzmj_game_flow_handler/32-重连-场景做牌.md",
    "section": "二、做牌界面",
    "fromLine": 25,
    "toLine": 25,
    "text": "做牌界面弹出：候选牌池（升序、可多选）、做牌座位、已选张数、对应功能页",
    "mandatory": true
  },
  {
    "ruleId": "R06-045",
    "file": ".claude/skills/game-prd-check/references/rules/hzmj_game_flow_handler/hzmj_game_flow_handler/32-重连-场景做牌.md",
    "section": "二、主界面操作区",
    "fromLine": 26,
    "toLine": 26,
    "text": "加倍阶段已结束时收起按钮页并隐藏倒计时；桌面加倍标签延迟1秒清除",
    "mandatory": true
  },
  {
    "ruleId": "R06-046",
    "file": ".claude/skills/game-prd-check/references/rules/hzmj_game_flow_handler/hzmj_game_flow_handler/32-重连-场景做牌.md",
    "section": "三、注意",
    "fromLine": 30,
    "toLine": 30,
    "text": "做牌数据、做牌权限没有只补数据分支，重连会重新弹出做牌界面（预期继续做牌）",
    "mandatory": true
  },
  {
    "ruleId": "R06-047",
    "file": ".claude/skills/game-prd-check/references/rules/hzmj_game_flow_handler/hzmj_game_flow_handler/32-重连-场景做牌.md",
    "section": "三、注意",
    "fromLine": 31,
    "toLine": 31,
    "text": "顺序必须先候选牌、后做牌权，因为做牌界面打开时要读取当前候选牌与做牌座位",
    "mandatory": true
  },
  {
    "ruleId": "R06-048",
    "file": ".claude/skills/game-prd-check/references/rules/hzmj_game_flow_handler/hzmj_game_flow_handler/32-重连-场景做牌.md",
    "section": "三、注意",
    "fromLine": 32,
    "toLine": 32,
    "text": "该阶段还没有对局手牌，不恢复手牌和河牌属于正常",
    "mandatory": true
  },
  {
    "ruleId": "R06-049",
    "file": ".claude/skills/game-prd-check/references/rules/hzmj_game_flow_handler/hzmj_game_flow_handler/33-重连-场景发牌旧协议.md",
    "section": "触发条件",
    "fromLine": 3,
